      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of command and the echo of battle must feel immense right now. It is a heavy burden to carry the weight of such a devastating mistake. Perhaps the path forward isn't about immediate honor, but about surviving the long night. Focus on the quiet task before you, whatever small act offers even a moment's respite.",
      "source": "target",
